# Social content is authored in this repo but never served by the site.
#
# Roughly 100MB of rendered PNGs and MP4s — carousels for Instagram and the
# 9:16 videos. Without this file the CLI uploads all of it on every deploy,
# which pushed the bundle past 108MB and made the upload itself the thing that
# failed. Nothing under here is imported by src/, so excluding it changes the
# build not at all and removes the failure mode entirely.
#
# The files are still committed and still in the repo — this only keeps them
# out of the deployment bundle.
YusufCreates Social Media/
Monday Posts/
Sunday Posts/
Logo:Favicon/

# Local render scratch
.playwright-mcp/
